  "notes": "Worked example of the target form. Every field below already exists in the backend: columns/constraints via _structured_record_controls, options via mysql_table_options.KEYS (TEXT/NUMBERS/CHOICES). backend_field_id maps typed fields back onto the mysql_table_options object until the provider accepts them flat.",
